  "limits": "Same locally built native library, same borrowed-array API and numerical kernels; only sharing differs. Separate creates one immutable prepared plan per frame worker. Production Qt MapModel and reader, full original Eiger file, warm OS cache, five alternating paired passes. Timed: opening, snapshotting, reading/decompression, image processing, changing threshold masks, normalization, integration and map assembly. GUI rendering excluded. Both pools remain resident to permit alternating warm trials, so warm RSS is combined process memory, not per-variant memory. First-run timings include setup, not cold disk IO. One PhaseSmith solver was observed active; measured other busy cores are recorded per trial."
